break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/25/0305992/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新衣装！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/25/0305992/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(暗くてごめんなさい。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネクタイが可愛いくて\nお気に入りです(ू ੭•͈ω•͈)੭｡.ﾟ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私はポニーテール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/25/0305992/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の「こんぺいとーく」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆密かな楽しみってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→学校から帰ってきてから\n少しだけお昼寝すること！\n膝の上にめいめい(愛猫)が\n乗ってきて一緒に寝るのが\n密かな楽しみ( 〃 > < 〃 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆たこちゅー顔して！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→こんな感じで\nいいのかなあ...(o˘◡˘o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/25/0305992/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆フエラムネって知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→知ってます！\n小さい頃おばあちゃんに\nよく買ってもらってました♪\nおまけが付いてるやつをよく\n買ってもらってました(^^)\nぴゅーぴゅー鳴らすんだけど\n食べたくなっちゃってすぐ\n食べちゃう♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆秋服のオススメは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→まだ秋服でいいのかなあ..(笑)\nもう冬服？まだかな？\n私は最近、グレーのお洋服に\nハマっています♪\nこの前はもこもこのパーカーを\n買いました(๑•ᴗ•๑)♡あ、でも\nこのパーカーは白！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆好きな飲み物は何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ほぼ毎日飲むほど、\n飲むヨーグルトが好きです！\n他はココア、野菜ジュース、\nミルクティーなどなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆握手会の前日は\nどうやって過ごしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→握手会の前日はブログの\nコメントを読み返して、\nお名前を確認してます！\n後はいつもよりお風呂が\n長め乁( ˙ω˙ 乁)笑\n早く寝ようと思っても\nワクワクしていつもより\n遅くなっちゃいます(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7枚目の握手会は個人での\n握手会になります！\n楽しみだけど少し不安な所も\nありますが、皆さんに\nお会い出来るのを楽しみに\nしてます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の「こんぺいとーく」は\nこれで終わりです(o˘◡˘o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ質問受付中です♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/25/0305992/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未さん /  堀未央奈 / 宮澤成良さん\n10月生まれの皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう\nございます( 〃 > < 〃 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せな1年になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/25/0305992/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"brea